<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 12:21:11 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a7087b48a5a6</link><description>&lt;p&gt;波音737-800的夜间双翼梢小翼。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Closeup view of an aircraft’s winglet against a dark night sky. The winglet features distinctive colors of Southwest Airlines." height="2688" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/mihobu/6a7087b48a5a6.jpg" width="2688"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://mihobu.some.pics"&gt;@mihobu&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 12:21:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a70876aa0093</link><description>&lt;p&gt;另一张西南航空翼尖小翼的照片，是在从图森飞往丹佛的航班上拍的。颜色有点偏，因为我忘了之前开启了富士胶片风格的LUT色彩预设。（不过这仍然是我那趟航班上拍得最好的一张。）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A close-up view of an aircraft’s winglet against a blue sky with clouds. The winglet features distinctive colors of Southwest Airlines." height="2684" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/mihobu/6a70876aa0093.jpg" width="2684"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://mihobu.some.pics"&gt;@mihobu&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 12:19:59 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>森林关闭，骑行小圈</title><link>https://some.pics/6a70767000036</link><description>&lt;p&gt;小骑了一圈，可惜森林还是关闭的。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="🚲 Klein rondje, het bos was spijtig genoeg nog afgesloten. " height="1486" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/atog/6a70767000036.jpg" width="1179"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://atog.some.pics"&gt;@atog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 11:07:30 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a7056a3ec13d</link><description>&lt;p&gt;安慰剂效应
#AltTxt&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Faded spotted St John’s wort (Hypericum maculatum). Although it is part of the St John’s wort family and is used, particularly in the north, as a disinfectant and in tea to treat all sorts of ailments, it does not have the same effect as common St John’s wort (Hypericum perforatum)" height="4000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6a7056a3ec13d.jpg" width="3000"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 08:51:51 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a6fa758b98ac</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Samantha Fish将于2026年6月19日在格罗洛举办的荷兰国际蓝调音乐节上演出。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Samantha Fish at the Holland International Blues Festival, Grolloo on 19th june 2026. " height="1427" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sybrand/6a6fa758b98ac.jpg" width="2360"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sybrand.some.pics"&gt;@sybrand&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 20:23:55 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>